{"3966300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Synth Laser", "steam_appid": 3966300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive this deadly laser show and beat nostalgia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a dynamic laser maze rhythm-avoider game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides a breathtaking laser show with the precision of rhythm games. Players must dodge the zapping lasers, timing each movement to the beat of a mesmerizing synthwave soundtrack, creating a uniquely immersive flow state. Developed by solo indie creator Sarah Noor, the game blends razor-sharp gameplay with a stunning outrun aesthetic, offering a fresh take on the rhythm-action genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a Music-based Laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Synthwave style graphics and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and weave through the deadly lasers of the laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the level and move side to side to dodge the lasers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Development: Sarah Noor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Environment and Lighting: Sherizox Entertainment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composition: Qais</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive this deadly laser show and beat nostalgia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a dynamic laser maze rhythm-avoider game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"b